        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "She has such wonderful energy. You feel incredibly comfortable with her right away. She's helped me a lot to grow and change some bad habits. She's an amazing person, go see her! 🤗",
        "time": 1764034477,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katiane Rémillard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104607624483694254562/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZTvF2hzoopN-oQPwyhErkzfU3spr80Hg78zbaiomnwvdkDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Nathalie is empathetic, cheerful, a good listener, and able to offer several solutions to help us. The hypnosis sessions help me tremendously with several aspects, such as anxiety and letting go. You feel completely at ease in her office! Thank you.",
        "time": 1746724165,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maxime Labbé",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109088176478186906037/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL35glRQlCQS105h74IVOYHUPAYE3EMTw-KB682tCW4MHY6Zw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Nathalie helped me get through a difficult time, thanks to her I was able to get through this phase feeling less stressed about the situation. She is so welcoming that you immediately feel confident! I subsequently referred several people who also had the same feeling! I highly recommend her!",
        "time": 1741095763,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lynda Seymour",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117435396430872947031/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPIJ7sAJ53naOwZy9d9xygzUDVBrwghY_5OwlWjvBV7ai3vYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "What a wonderful encounter with Nathalie... She has unparalleled empathy, demonstrates a great deal of listening skills and solutions too! She knows how to make us see things differently and opens the doors to various avenues of solution. I highly recommend her... which I have already done, in fact :) Thank you Nathalie!",
        "time": 1741095919,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jamila Richer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116742012812953371813/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwIg0vr9-zQrp_XeQdXP5BeUHS_vOvuDhS9xn4hn5cosQaQFmj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Meeting Nathalie about three months ago was one of the best things that ever happened to me. Not knowing much about hypnosis, she guided me through the process in a very patient and informative way. Thanks to Nathalie, I've completely changed my lifestyle. I'm keeping all her great tips and advice handy to maintain a healthy lifestyle. It really works! I recommend her 100%.",
